{"title": "Legendary Action: Psionic Visage", "pageid": 30190, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Psionic_Visage", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Legendary_Action_Utility.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Legendary_Action_Utility.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Utility.webp, /w/images/4/4b/Legendary_Action_Utility.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Legendary_Action_Utility.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Utility.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Legendary_Action_Utility.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Legendary Action: Psionic Visage</b> is a legendary <a href=\"/wiki/Passive_feature\" title=\"Passive feature\">passive feature</a> available to <a href=\"/wiki/Nere\" title=\"Nere\">Nere</a> in Honour mode.\nWhen attacked, Nere can cast <a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Visage\" title=\"Psionic Visage\">Psionic Visage</a> to protect himself from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Physical\" title=\"Physical\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Physical\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Physical\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Physical\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">Physical</span></a> damage with 3 psionic copies of himself.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Once per round, Nere can use his Legendary Action to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Visage\" title=\"Psionic Visage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psionic Visage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Visage\" title=\"Psionic Visage\">Psionic Visage</a> on himself when attacked. \n</p><p>When he is attacked, Nere's summoned visages will <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shatter_Visage\" title=\"Shatter Visage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Detonate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shatter_Visage\" title=\"Shatter Visage\">Detonate</a>.\n</p><p><span style=\"color: white;\">Legendary Actions restore at the start of each round.</span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Legendary_Action:_Psionic_Visage\"> Condition: Legendary Action: Psionic Visage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Psionic_Visage_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Psionic Visage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Psionic Visage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Psionic_Visage_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Psionic Visage (Condition)\">Legendary Action: Psionic Visage</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Nere can immediately cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Visage\" title=\"Psionic Visage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psionic Visage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Visage\" title=\"Psionic Visage\">Psionic Visage</a> on himself when attacked.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Nere\" title=\"Nere\">Nere</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Occasionally no copies get summoned - even if they should - when Nere is hit inside a Hunger of Hadar spell (for example, by an eldritch blast), it is possible that sight of the damage source is needed for the ability to be activated. <sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"Needs verification.\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup></li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">After being hit, Nere can cast Psionic Visage to protect himself.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203241\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1541/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 15530/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7606/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 115/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 704403/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.649      1 -total\n 99.23%   45.296      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 40.58%   18.523      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 35.38%   16.150      1 Template:PageSeo\n 31.63%   14.440      4 Template:Icon_link\n 30.50%   13.923  